  "title": "Yellow Peppered Croatian Fish Stew",
  "description": "A sweet and dense Croatian dish featuring black pepper, perfect for a weeknight dinner, this stew is made by poaching fish and vegetables in a hot pot vessel, and can be enjoyed with raw friendly ingredients on the side.",
