  "instructions": [
    "Heat the white wine and fish stock in a hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced yellow bell pepper and cook until tender.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cod fish and cook until opaque and flaky.",
    "Stir in the smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Offer raw friendly ingredients like lemon wedges and crusty bread on the side."
